questions.description:
Complete the statement to get all departments including those with no teachers assigned.

SELECT d.name, t.first_name
FROM departments d ___ JOIN teachers t ON d.id = t.department_id;

Complete the statement to find students not enrolled in any course.

SELECT first_name FROM students
WHERE id ___ (SELECT student_id FROM enrollments);

